{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"QueryFilter","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A filter can require component types, exclude them, require components added or changed since","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a tick, and require a relation to a target. Filters read nothing: an entity’s components decide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whether it passes, but a query’s rows carry only the values of its terms."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Build a filter from a static method such as "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/with(_:)-swift.type.method","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and refine it with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the instance methods of the same names. Each method returns a new filter that an entity passes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only if it meets every condition. To pass entities that meet at least one of several filters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/anyOf(_:)-swift.type.method","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", so you can write any condition on which component types an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity holds:"}]},{"code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Name(value: \"drifter\"), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"statue\"), Frozen())","world.spawn